OL,5,G0250 Ramsay's Hotel Hell
OL,6,     FThe Keating: Gordon checks into
OL,7,     FThe Keating, a boutique hotel in
OL,8,     FSan Diego, California. Its owner
OL,9,     Fhas blown millions on design but
OL,10,     Fhasn't spent on items the guests
OL,11,     Freally need.
OL,12,G0340 Yorkshire by the Sea
OL,13,     FIn Scarborough, we hit the waves
OL,14,     Fwith an accessible surfing group.
OL,15,     FAnd in Robin Hood's Bay, an
OL,16,     Fambitious couple launch their
OL,17,     Ffirst wine from their vineyard.
OL,18,     F(Ep3/4)
