OL,5,G0435 Kirstie's House of Craft
OL,6,     FKirstie Allsopp shows us how to
OL,7,     Fcreate beautiful crafts with items
OL,8,     Fwe already own. She makes a fun
OL,9,     Fgarland from paper, a beautiful
OL,10,     Fspring wreath, and a string-art
OL,11,     Fhot air balloon.
OL,12,G0455 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FThree couples compete to host the
OL,14,     Fbest dinner party in and around
OL,15,     FNewcastle. There's Scottish fare
OL,16,     Fand assumptions about accents, and
OL,17,     Fa dessert nearly goes up in
OL,18,     Fflames!
